// Design contract (see docs + the SP-1 grounding workflow):
//   * nd::Array<T> is a C-order (row-major) flat buffer + shape + strides +
//     offset. T in {double, int64_t, bool}. Views share the buffer via a
//     std::shared_ptr so slice()/newaxis()/transpose() are O(1) and safe.
